msgstr "重置到最新的稳定版本"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6015 lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6018
msgid "Installed: v"
msgstr "已安装：v"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6027
msgid "Pack editor…"
msgstr "摆件包编辑器…"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6072
msgid "Flexible shelf widths"
msgstr "自适应书架宽度"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6073
msgid "Off: every shelf gets the same width. On: each shelf is sized to its label, so single-icon shelves stay narrow and longer text labels get more room. Falls back to equal widths when natural sizes don't fit."
msgstr "关闭：所有书架按钮宽度统一固定。开启：各书架按文字内容自适应尺寸，仅图标无文字的书架保持窄幅，文字较长的书架自动拓宽。若自适应后整体超出栏宽，自动变回等宽布局。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6088
msgid "Uppercase labels"
msgstr "标签大写"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6089
msgid "On: shelf names and the drill breadcrumb are shown in capitals, the default look. Off: each label reads exactly as you typed it, so \"Sci-Fi\" stays \"Sci-Fi\"."
msgstr "开启：书架名称和逐层浏览时的路径导航均以大写显示，这是默认外观。关闭：每个标签完全按你输入的样子显示，「Sci-Fi」就保持为「Sci-Fi」。"

#: lib/bookshelf_settings.lua:6167
msgid "Tap a shelf to edit it. Long-press to show or hide it."
msgstr "点击书架可编辑，长按可显示或隐藏。"

